message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: Naveed
    given-names: Aamna
title: "Wildfire Recovery Geospatial Modeling"
abstract: >-
  Spatially explicit modelling of post-fire vegetation recovery across
  15 California wildfires (2018–2022) using Sentinel-2, MTBS, NASADEM,
  ERA5-Land, and ESA WorldCover. Evaluates persistence, Random Forest,
  and XGBoost under leave-one-fire-out and leave-one-ecosystem-out
  cross-validation.
version: 0.9.0
date-released: 2026-10-02
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AamnaNaveed/wildfire-recovery-geospatial-modeling"
keywords:
  - wildfire
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - burn severity
  - dNBR
  - spatial cross-validation
  - machine learning
  - California